+## Experimental conditional delivery example
+
+For a separate Testnet-only demonstration of payment release publishing a decryption key, see the {% repo-link path="_code-samples/x402-key-reveal-escrow/" %}key-reveal escrow example{% /repo-link %}. It includes offline tests and an explicitly opted-in ledger run with create, finish, replay, and withheld-key cancellation. It uses an experimental `key-reveal-escrow` scheme with `xrpl.js`; the `x402-xrpl` exact payer and facilitator do not implement that scheme. The ledger can prove the key was revealed, but cannot judge article quality. Cancellation requires an explicit `EscrowCancel` after the deadline, and refunds after a successful finish still require the writer's cooperation.
+
 ## Prerequisites
 
 - Python 3.11+
